        "verse": 5
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1TI",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "For it is sanctified through the word of God and prayer.",
      "ko": "하나님의 말씀과 기도로 거룩하여짐이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "635a0e19881a56353106d2fd051e65a7c739ba8a213cda801d4fe6b0cc555ff1",
      "translation_text_hash": "4767af000d06e6b2232fab14b71ffc84c50a876c75a14bbb8ce855ad6e1ff24c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
